  "details": "# Issue:\n\nThe Vive 2.0 System Tracker Models look way too shiny.\n\n**Reproduction Steps:**\n\n1. Be in FBT with Vive 2.0 Trackers\n\n2. Go to the VRChat Home World\n\n3. Set Tracker Model in the Tracking & IK settings to system\n\n4. Open the Main Menu and look at your trackers.\n\nOther trackers could also be effected when using the System Models, but I only have Vive 2.0s for testing.\n\n# Expected Behaviour:\n\nThey shouldn't be this shiny lol\n\n# Attachments:\n\nHere is a picture showcasing them:",
